            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Cornice 0.4.0</h2><p>Added optional setup, signed in-app updates, music recovery, work/break focus sessions, saved timer presets and quiet completion.</p><p>Timers and focus sessions restore after relaunch. System now shows memory pressure and reported battery condition. Keyboard controls and Reduce Motion behavior have also been improved.</p><p>Keyboard: Control-Option-Command-D to toggle the panel, Command-1/2/3 to switch panels, Escape to close.</p>]]></description>
